---
description: Form concession-traceable compromise options without treating silence as acceptance.
args:{scope:GoalContract;positions:StageResultStakeholderPosition;conflicts:StageResultRequirementConflict;agreements:EvidencePage[];interfaceOwners:EvidencePage[]}
returns:StageResultCompromiseOption
---
Bind alternatives = `varyNegotiationDimensions(scope, positions.accepted, conflicts.accepted, conflicts.unresolved)`. Explore release phase, mode, risk tier or bounded scope only where supplied evidence permits. Keep each mandatory constraint intact, name who gives up what and every new assumption, and include no agreement. Bind confirmation states to exact option version; any change affecting another team's interface requires that owner’s review. Unaccepted alternatives remain proposals.
